# File: .gitignore
# Assignment 4
# October 23, 2026
#
# Lists files and folders that Git should never track or upload to GitHub.
# Most of this is Vite's default list. The important addition for this
# assignment is the .env section, which keeps the TMDB API token private.

# ---------- Secrets (added for Assignment 4) ----------
# The .env file holds VITE_TMDB_TOKEN, so it must never be committed.
.env
.env.*

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
